# Facts about Corvin Ashby.

@fact corvin.locks
tier: surface
text: Knows every locked door in the academy and owes money to at least three people.

@fact corvin.last_warning
tier: personal
hint: One more detention would cost him more than an evening.
unlock: seen(corvin_rooftop) > 0
text: He is on his last warning. One more detention and they send him home, and home is not a good place.

@fact corvin.brother
tier: secret
hint: Not all of his family writes kindly.
unlock: seen(corvin_brother) > 0
text: His brother turns up for money and threatens to tell the headmistress where Corvin learned to pick locks.

@fact corvin.grandfather
tier: personal
hint: The confiscation vault keeps more than contraband.
unlock: seen(corvin_confiscation_vault) > 0
text: His grandfather's lucky deck sat in the confiscation vault for decades. It really is lucky.

@fact corvin.cartographers
tier: secret
hint: Some clubs don't put up posters.
unlock: member(cartographers)
text: He runs the Midnight Cartographers, the club that doesn't exist.

@fact corvin.trolls
tier: personal
hint: Ask him about money, if you dare.
unlock: seen(corvin_debt) > 0
text: He once owed thirty crowns to trolls and offered to pay you back with a goat.

@fact corvin.sundays
tier: personal
hint: There's one person he talks about without a joke.
unlock: seen(corvin_lucky_deck) > 0
text: His grandfather could find a lost thing in any house, and taught him to shuffle on rainy Sundays. He's the one person Corvin talks about without a joke.

@fact corvin.master_map
tier: secret
hint: Ask what the Cartographers keep.
unlock: flag(carto_map_chain)
text: The Cartographers' last Keeper left him the Master Map this summer. Whoever draws two lines in its old blanks keeps it with him.
